OL,3,GLondon & South East
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FLargely fine
OL,6,Fand dry overnight, with winds easing
OL,7,Fto become light and variable. Although
OL,8,Fthe odd isolated light shower cannot
OL,9,Fbe ruled out at first. Largely clear
OL,10,Fskies developing towards dawn, with
OL,11,Fthe odd patch of mist or fog possible.
OL,12,
OL,13,CSunday:FFine and dry, with light winds
OL,14,Fand some patchy fair weather cloud
OL,15,Fdeveloping through the day. Becoming
OL,16,Fcloudier overnight, with a
OL,17,Fstrengthening breeze. Temperatures
OL,18,Fnear normal for October.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
